        <p class="muted">余额跨现场轮休项目累计，不随上方月份或项目筛选变化；与通用调休余额分别计算。</p>
        <p v-if="entitlement.updated_at" class="muted">最近更新：{{ entitlement.updated_at }}</p>
      </template>
    </section>
    <section v-if="manageView" class="service-card"><h2>项目人员待休余额</h2><p v-for="b in data.balances" :key="b.employee_id">{{b.employee_name || '本人'}}：<strong>{{b.days}}天</strong></p><p v-if="!data.balances.length">0天</p></section>
    <section v-if="canPunch && entitlement.pending_confirmation.length" class="service-card"><h2>待确认的出勤</h2><p v-for="item in entitlement.pending_confirmation" :key="`${item.date}-${item.project_id}`">{{ item.date }} · {{ projectName(item.project_id) }} · 建议计 {{ item.suggested_days }} 天<span v-if="item.reason"> · {{ item.reason }}</span></p></section>
    <section v-if="canPunch && entitlement.planned_rest.length" class="service-card"><h2>已安排的休息</h2><p v-for="item in entitlement.planned_rest" :key="`${item.date}-${item.project_id}`">{{ item.date }} · {{ item.project_id ? projectName(item.project_id) : '待分配项目' }} · {{ restStatusLabel(item.status) }}</p></section>
    <section v-if="canPunch" class="service-card"><h2>个人排班日历</h2><p class="muted">未发布日期为待确认；待规则生效或待分配项目的日期不能据此打卡，也不计算工时或额度。休息日按“待兑现、待审批、已批准”等状态显示。</p><div class="calendar-grid"><span v-for="w in ['一','二','三','四','五','六','日']" :key="w" class="weekday">{{w}}</span><span v-for="i in monthOffset" :key="`blank-${i}`"></span><div v-for="d in calendarDays" :key="d.date" :class="['day',d.status==='pending_rule'||d.status==='pending_project'?'draft':d.kind,{today:d.date===today,'rest-awaiting':d.kind==='rest'&&restNeedsAction(d.rest_status)}]"><b>{{Number(d.date.slice(-2))}}</b><small>{{d.status==='pending_rule'||d.status==='pending_project' ? labels[d.kind] : d.label}}</small><small v-if="d.status==='pending_rule'||d.status==='pending_project'" class="draft-status">{{personStatusLabel(d.status)}}</small><small v-else-if="d.kind==='rest'&&d.rest_status" :class="restNeedsAction(d.rest_status)?'draft-status':''">{{restStatusLabel(d.rest_status)}}</small><small v-if="d.shift_label">{{shiftLabel(d.shift_label)}}</small><small v-if="d.status!=='pending_rule' && d.status!=='pending_project' && d.required_hours">{{d.required_hours}}h</small></div></div></section>
    <section v-if="manageView" class="service-card"><h2>项目每周排班</h2><p class="muted">按北京时间周一至周日查看。规则前已确认计划仅供查看，不开放打卡或待休计算；正式发布后的调班须逐级审核。</p><div class="service-row week-nav"><button @click="moveWeek(-1)">上周</button><strong>{{weekStart}} — {{weekEnd}}</strong><button @click="moveWeek(1)">下周</button><button @click="goThisWeek">本周</button></div><article v-for="d in weekScheduleRows" :key="`${d.status || 'published'}-${d.employee_id}-${d.date}-${d.project_id}`" class="claim"><strong>{{d.employee_name}} · {{d.date}}</strong><p>{{projectName(d.project_id)}} · {{d.status==='pending_rule'||d.status==='pending_project' ? labels[d.kind] : d.label || labels[d.kind]}}<span v-if="d.shift_label"> · {{shiftLabel(d.shift_label)}}</span><span v-if="d.status==='pending_rule'||d.status==='pending_project'" class="draft-status"> · {{personStatusLabel(d.status)}}</span><span v-else-if="d.kind==='rest'&&d.rest_status"> · {{restStatusLabel(d.rest_status)}}</span><span v-else> · 应出勤 {{d.required_hours || 0}} 小时</span></p><button v-if="d.status!=='pending_rule' && d.status!=='pending_project' && canScheduleProject(d.project_id)" @click="openAdjustment(d)">申请调整</button></article><p v-if="!weekScheduleRows.length" class="muted">该周暂无已确认排班，可查看以往各周。</p></section>
